{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-01-20 08:01:00', 'title': 'LEADING PARTNERS JOIN FORCES WITH EQUINIX TO TEST SUSTAINABLE DATA CENTER INNOVATIONS INCLUDING FUEL CELL AND LIQUID COOLING TECHNOLOGIES', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., JAN. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF ITS FIRST CO-INNOVATION FACILITY (CIF), LOCATED IN ITS DC15 INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS EXCHANGE™ (IBX®) DATA CENTER AT THE EQUINIX ASHBURN CAMPUS IN THE WASHINGTON, D.C."}